; mess_codec.SCR — Codec trigger script for the Mess Hall stage
; Fires when Snake enters the TRIGGER_CODEC volume (near kitchen counter)
; Uses MGS1 PC script opcode format.
;
; Opcodes reference:
;   CALL_CODEC  <freq>, <speaker>, <anim>   — open codec window
;   DIALOGUE    <string_id>                 — play/display line
;   WAIT_INPUT                              — wait for player to press action
;   END_CALL                                — close codec window
;   SET_FLAG    <flag_id>                   — mark event as seen

;===========================================================================
; EVENT: CODEC_0x20 — Otacon calls when Snake reaches the counter
; Fires once per playthrough (FLAG_MESS_CODEC_SEEN gates it)
;===========================================================================

[EVENT  CODEC_0x20]
CHECK_FLAG  FLAG_MESS_CODEC_SEEN
IF_SET      SKIP_TO END_CODEC_0x20

CALL_CODEC  140.85  OTACON  CODEC_ANIM_ADJUST_GLASSES

DIALOGUE    "Hey, Snake — you found the mess hall."
WAIT_INPUT

DIALOGUE    "The soldiers eat here in rotating shifts. Breakfast is at 0600, lunch at 1200, dinner at 1800. They get forty minutes each."
WAIT_INPUT

DIALOGUE    "The kitchen's fully stocked — they keep a lot of rations on site. Cold weather makes people eat more, I guess."
WAIT_INPUT

DIALOGUE    "I actually snuck in here once, before... before everything went wrong. I was trying to get to the communications tower."
WAIT_INPUT

DIALOGUE    "The food was terrible, by the way. Government-issue everything. But I grabbed a ketchup bottle — the real kind, not the packets."
WAIT_INPUT

DIALOGUE    "...I hid it somewhere in here, actually. You might want to hold onto it. Trust me."
WAIT_INPUT

END_CALL

SET_FLAG    FLAG_MESS_CODEC_SEEN

LABEL  END_CODEC_0x20
NOP

;===========================================================================
; EVENT: CODEC_0x21 — Optional follow-up if Snake calls Otacon in this room
; Triggered by player manually calling 140.85 while FLAG_MESS_CODEC_SEEN is set
;===========================================================================

[EVENT  CODEC_0x21]
CHECK_FLAG  FLAG_MESS_CODEC_SEEN
IF_NOT_SET  SKIP_TO END_CODEC_0x21

CALL_CODEC  140.85  OTACON  CODEC_ANIM_THINKING

CHECK_FLAG  FLAG_KETCHUP_COLLECTED
IF_SET      GOTO  CODEC_0x21_KETCHUP

DIALOGUE    "You're still in the mess hall? Watch out for the guard on the far side — he has a wider patrol at mealtime."
WAIT_INPUT
GOTO END_CODEC_0x21

LABEL  CODEC_0x21_KETCHUP
DIALOGUE    "Oh, you found it! The ketchup. Good. I hope you know what to do with it. ...Don't eat it."
WAIT_INPUT

END_CALL

LABEL  END_CODEC_0x21
NOP
